{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Graunt API","version":"0.1.0","description":"Graunt is a marketplace for agent-ready data: evaluated packet assets (datasets and text bundles) for agents, builders, and machine buyers. Listings expose stable IDs, declared rights, provenance metadata, packet checks, pricing, acquisition requirements, and manifest references where available. There is no public composite quality score, quality filter, or quality sort. This document covers only endpoints that exist at runtime today. Money values are integer cents. Stripe is the current payment processor. Current marketplace pricing metadata is published at /v1/meta/pricing. Graunt is operated from the United States and all amounts are in USD. Sales tax is added to the buyer total only for destinations where Graunt holds an active tax registration."},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.graunt.com","description":"Machine host"}],"tags":[{"name":"Public discovery","description":"Unauthenticated read endpoints — health/ready/pricing, listing search and detail, public signing-key registry, signed manifest fetch."},{"name":"Authenticated retrieval","description":"Authenticated reads of caller-owned resources — buyer entitlement download, seller's own datasets."},{"name":"Authenticated purchase","description":"Buyer-initiated purchase flow. Current paid purchase execution runs through authenticated buyer-organization accounts; unauthenticated agent paid checkout is not part of the current public surface."},{"name":"Seller","description":"Seller persona — registration, login, dataset upload, listing CRUD, payouts, Stripe Connect onboarding, signing-key management, and the seller listings inventory."},{"name":"Meta","description":"Reserved tag. The public meta surface declared under it is the health/ready/pricing trio."},{"name":"Admin","description":"Reserved tag. Admin routes are not exposed in the public OpenAPI surface (see FORBIDDEN_PATH_PREFIXES)."},{"name":"Anonymous drafts","description":"Discovery-key-scoped packet-draft preparation before registration. A gdk_live_* bearer creates a private draft, attaches metadata and source files, validates, attests, and submits it for review. Drafts stay private to the key — never searchable, never catalog-visible — and move to the account that claims the key. Cross-key access collapses to 404; create is per-IP rate-limited; Cache-Control: no-store on every response."},{"name":"Support","description":"Support intake — open a tracked support issue, question, or product feedback, and read your own issues. Signed-in orgs submit under their org; agent bearers use the support:create scope; anonymous submissions carry a contact email that is hashed server-side and never stored raw. The human front door is /support."},{"name":"Graunt Links","description":"Read-only URL link planes. Every Graunt credential is usable as one paste-able URL: /p/{pass} (access-pass content, manifest, ask, resources, and per-packet navigation: /p/{pass}/pkg/{n} table of contents + /p/{pass}/pkg/{n}/file/{m} text pages, backed by the pass-authed canonical routes GET /v1/access-passes/packets/{n} and /packets/{n}/files/{m}; plus /p/{pass}/index.html for a guaranteed-HTML entry page, /p/{pass}/llms.txt for a bounded single-fetch aggregate, and /p/{pass}/map.json for the machine file map) and /k/{key} (discovery-key public catalog search + listing detail). Assistants that fetch URLs can read entitled content through a pass link; API agents may continue to use Bearer credentials. The token travels in the path (x-graunt-token-in-path); responses are Markdown by default (Accept: application/json for the JSON envelope). Read-only — no mutation, no purchase, no revoke. Unavailable tokens collapse to 404; no token-shaped examples appear in this document."}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"JWT","description":"JWT issued by POST /v1/auth/login or POST /v1/auth/register. Pass as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`."},"agentBearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"grnt_agent","description":"Scoped bearer token issued by POST /v1/agents/credentials. Format: `grnt_agent_<64-hex>`. Required for /v1/agents/purchases/* and /v1/agents/listings/* routes. The MCP read transport is live at POST /v1/mcp (the connector endpoint; a credential is optional there and widens the tool catalog) and at POST /v1/mcp/messages (credential required); see GET /v1/mcp/server-info; the autonomous verified-agent principal is not live — capability states are machine-readable at /v1/meta/capabilities."},"accessPassBearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"gap_live","description":"Short-lived read-only Graunt Access Pass token. Format: `gap_live_<64-hex>`. Issued by POST /v1/access-passes; surfaced once in the create-response body. Required for POST /v1/access-passes/resolve and the GET /v1/access-passes/manifest|resources|resources/:id endpoints. Read-only: cannot purchase, publish, refund, or mutate. Submit via the Authorization header — never as a URL parameter or in the request body. Assistants that only fetch URLs use the read-only /p/<pass> link plane instead."},"packetAccessKeyBearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"gpak_live","description":"Durable read-only packet access key. Format: `gpak_live_<64-hex>`. Issued by POST /v1/entitlements/{id}/packet-access-keys; the raw key is surfaced once in the create-response body. Bound to exactly one entitlement — reads against any other entitlement return 404. Read-only: cannot purchase, publish, issue, or revoke keys. Submit via Authorization header only — never as a URL parameter."},"apiKeyAuth":{"type":"apiKey","in":"header","name":"X-API-Key","description":"Scoped long-lived app credential. Pass as `X-API-Key: grnt_live_<64-hex>` (header only, never a URL parameter). v0 scopes: listings:read, search:read, entitlements:read, access-pass:create, receipts:read. A request whose key lacks the required scope is rejected 403 API_KEY_SCOPE_DENIED with no fall-through to a broader auth basis."}},"schemas":{"Error":{"type":"object","required":["ok","error"],"properties":{"ok":{"const":false},"error":{"type":"object","required":["code","message"],"properties":{"code":{"type":"string","description":"Stable machine-readable error code (e.g. VALIDATION_ERROR, NOT_FOUND, FORBIDDEN)."},"message":{"type":"string"},"details":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}}}}},"HealthCheck":{"type":"object","required":["ok","timestamp","schema_version"],"properties":{"ok":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when all required dependencies are healthy. HTTP status is always 200 so external uptime monitors can body-match."},"timestamp":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"schema_version":{"type":"string"}}},"Readiness":{"type":"object","required":["ready","timestamp"],"properties":{"ready":{"type":"boolean"},"timestamp":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"database":{"type":"string","enum":["ok","error"]},"redis":{"type":"string","enum":["ok","error"]}}},"ListingDraft":{"type":"object","required":["id","org_id","status","current_step","autosave_revision","payload","created_at","updated_at"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"org_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["IN_PROGRESS","SUBMITTED","ABANDONED"]},"current_step":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":5},"autosave_revision":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"title_preview":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"submitted_listing_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true},"payload":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"description":"Per-step partial state; strict per-step shape follows the legacy listing-draft 5-step layout (the draft records remain API-manageable; the manual wizard UI is retired — sellers use the Refinery)."},"notes":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"created_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"updated_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"PricingInfo":{"type":"object","description":"Platform fee + buyer fee schedule. Values are integer cents unless noted."},"ListingSummary":{"type":"object","required":["id","dataset_name","category","price_cents","tags"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"dataset_name":{"type":"string"},"category":{"type":"string"},"asset_class":{"type":"string","enum":["DATASET","TEXT_ASSET","PACKET_BUNDLE"],"description":"Projected, not stored. A bundle-backed listing has no dataset row and projects PACKET_BUNDLE."},"file_format":{"type":"string"},"price_cents":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Listing price in USD cents. Use 0 for a free listing or at least the marketplace paid-order minimum (50) for a paid listing."},"currency":{"type":"string","enum":["usd"]},"is_free":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when price_cents = 0 (free listing)."},"acquisition_mode":{"type":"string","enum":["PAID_ENTITLED","AUTHENTICATED_FREE_ENTITLED","PUBLIC_TOKEN_GRANT_FREE"],"description":"How the listing is acquired. PAID_ENTITLED: Stripe paid checkout via authenticated buyer org. AUTHENTICATED_FREE_ENTITLED: free acquisition by an authenticated buyer org through POST /v1/purchases (no Stripe call). PUBLIC_TOKEN_GRANT_FREE: anonymous rate-limited grant minting via POST /v1/listings/:id/access-grants."},"payment_required":{"type":"boolean"},"registration_required":{"type":"boolean"},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"bundle_asset_count":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":1,"description":"Source files in the published bundle revision. Counts the source inventory only: generated machine artifacts (sidecars, indexes) are delivered with the bundle but are not counted here. Null when delivery_kind is SINGLE_FILE. This is the value min_bundle_asset_count / max_bundle_asset_count filter on, and it matches packet_bundle.asset_count on the detail endpoint."},"bundle_total_bytes":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":0,"description":"Total bytes of those source files, so a caller can size a delivery before requesting it. Null when delivery_kind is SINGLE_FILE. Matches packet_bundle.total_bytes on the detail endpoint."},"created_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"ListingDetail":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ListingSummary"},{"type":"object","properties":{"dataset_description":{"type":"string"},"dataset_row_count":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":0},"intended_uses":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"rights_attestation":{"type":"boolean"},"related_listings":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"description":"Up to four other ACTIVE listings related to this one: the same seller's listings first, then listings sharing a topic tag, each newest first. Disclosure, not a recommendation ranking - the order is structural, nothing is scored, and a seller cannot pay to appear here. Absent (not an empty array) when nothing relates.","items":{"type":"object","required":["id","dataset_name","price_cents","is_free","delivery_kind","bundle_asset_count","relation"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"dataset_name":{"type":"string"},"price_cents":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"is_free":{"type":"boolean"},"delivery_kind":{"type":"string","enum":["PACKET_BUNDLE","SINGLE_FILE"]},"bundle_asset_count":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":1,"description":"Source files in that listing's published bundle revision; null when it is a single file."},"relation":{"type":"string","enum":["SAME_SELLER","SHARED_TOPIC"],"description":"Why this listing is offered: the same seller published it, or it shares at least one topic tag."}}}},"content_excerpt":{"type":"object","description":"A sample of the packet's actual content, quotable under the licence named in license_family. Present only for free, ACTIVE, single-file text packets whose declared rights permit republication - absent (not empty) otherwise, which is the common case. The text is a bounded prefix, never the whole artifact unless is_truncated is false. Attribution obligations belong to the licence: CC_BY and CC_BY_SA require crediting the publisher named in seller_org_name.","required":["text","is_truncated","license_family"],"properties":{"text":{"type":"string","description":"The excerpt itself, verbatim from the source file. When the source is longer than the size cap it is cut at the last line break inside the cap; a source with no line break inside the cap is cut at the last whole character instead, so a single-line document is truncated mid-line. A line boundary is not a record boundary in every format either - a CSV field may legally contain a newline - so treat any excerpt with is_truncated true as a text sample rather than as parseable rows."},"is_truncated":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when this is a prefix of a longer file; false when it is the complete file. A consumer that presents a truncated excerpt as the whole dataset misrepresents what the buyer would receive."},"license_family":{"type":"string","enum":["CC0","PUBLIC_DOMAIN","GOVERNMENT_WORK","CC_BY","CC_BY_SA"],"description":"The declared licence family under which this text may be reused. Only these families produce an excerpt; the value is the seller's declaration, which Graunt records rather than adjudicates."}}},"early_listing":{"type":"object","description":"Present only on an early listing — a held listing from a seller who has not finished registering, reachable by direct link only (never in catalog or search). The buyer's card is authorized, not charged; access is immediate; the charge happens only if the seller completes registration within the capture window, otherwise the authorization is released and the buyer keeps access.","required":["seller_label","buyer_note","capture_window_hours","purchase_route"],"properties":{"seller_label":{"type":"string"},"buyer_note":{"type":"string"},"capture_window_hours":{"type":"integer"},"purchase_route":{"const":"/v1/purchases/held"}}},"provenance":{"type":"object","properties":{"publication_date":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"version_identifier":{"type":["string","null"]},"source_url":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uri"},"fetched_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"citation_template":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"rights_passport":{"type":"object","description":"Listing-level seller Rights Passport declaration (access mode, delivery mode, license posture, allowed/prohibited actions, obligations; vocabulary at GET /v1/meta/seller-standards). Additive OPTIONAL fields: `agent_metered_access` (boolean — the packet is priced per agent call/session rather than a flat entitlement) and `credit_unit_label` (string, 1..64 chars, e.g. `per_call`). Both fields are absent unless the seller declares them; declaration only, never an enforcement or ranking signal.","properties":{"agent_metered_access":{"type":"boolean","description":"OPTIONAL. True when the packet is priced per agent call/session rather than a flat entitlement. Absent when undeclared."},"credit_unit_label":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":64,"description":"OPTIONAL. Seller-declared metering unit label, e.g. `per_call` or `per_session`. Absent when undeclared."}}},"packet_checks":{"type":"object","description":"Bounded presence-and-fact summary of the listing: declared rights, license family and obligations, provenance recording, manifest references, validation status, content metadata. No composite score, no per-dimension scores, no rank input."},"evaluation_summary":{"type":"object","description":"Narrative companion to packet_checks. The statement describes what packet_checks summarizes: available metadata and objective validation facts."},"download_requires_account_entitlement":{"type":"boolean","description":"True for PAID_ENTITLED and AUTHENTICATED_FREE_ENTITLED listings; download flows through GET /v1/entitlements/:id/download."},"download_requires_access_grant":{"type":"boolean","description":"True for PUBLIC_TOKEN_GRANT_FREE listings; download flows through GET /v1/listings/:id/free-download with a grant token."},"public_free_access":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"Present (non-null) only when acquisition_mode = PUBLIC_TOKEN_GRANT_FREE. Carries grant + download endpoints, grant TTL, rate-limit caps, and a rights/terms notice.","properties":{"enabled":{"const":true},"grant_endpoint":{"type":"string"},"download_endpoint":{"type":"string"},"grant_ttl_seconds":{"type":"integer","minimum":60,"maximum":3600},"rate_limit":{"type":"object","properties":{"per_ip_per_window":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"window_seconds":{"type":"integer","minimum":60},"per_ip_per_day":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"global_per_day":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}}},"terms_notice":{"type":"string"}}},"delivery_kind":{"type":"string","enum":["SINGLE_FILE","PACKET_BUNDLE"],"description":"Single-file dataset vs frozen packet bundle. Both delivery kinds are publicly visible on the catalog. SINGLE_FILE delivers via GET /v1/entitlements/{id}/download; PACKET_BUNDLE delivers via GET /v1/entitlements/{id}/packet-bundle (manifest + per-asset presigned URLs). Public listing detail returns the bundle aggregate (asset_count, manifest_sha256, total_bytes) without per-asset details — those return through the entitlement after acquisition."},"packet_bundle":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"Bundle aggregate (bundle_id, revision_id, revision_number, manifest_sha256, asset_count, total_bytes, frozen_at) when delivery_kind=PACKET_BUNDLE; null when SINGLE_FILE."},"commercial_terms":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CommercialTerms","description":"Bounded, agent-readable commercial-terms aggregate. Same shape is persisted as an immutable purchase-time snapshot at purchase creation (see InitiatePurchaseResponse). Forbidden public fields: platform fee, seller net, payout split, allocation rows, raw payment-processor objects, presigned URLs, PII."}}}]},"CommercialTerms":{"type":"object","description":"Bounded, agent-readable commercial-terms aggregate (schema_version 2). Built deterministically from existing listing fields. Same shape is the strict-validated snapshot persisted at purchase creation; never rebuilt thereafter. Snapshots captured before v2 carry schema_version 1 and no additional_seller_terms key — consumers should branch on schema_version.","required":["schema_version","listing_id","listing_status","listing_updated_at_utc","pricing","acquisition","delivery","packet","rights","publication","checkout","additional_seller_terms"],"properties":{"schema_version":{"type":"integer","enum":[1,2],"description":"2 on all newly emitted objects. 1 appears only on immutable purchase snapshots captured before the seller-additional-terms release."},"additional_seller_terms":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"The seller's optional additional terms attached to this listing — a bounded reference (never the raw body). Null when the seller attached none. The terms text is served by GET /v1/listings/{id}/seller-terms. Presentation/disclosure only: these terms never gate purchase, and the platform Terms of Service acceptance flow is unchanged.","required":["terms_doc_id","label","content_sha256","retrieved_at"],"properties":{"terms_doc_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"label":{"type":"string","maxLength":120},"content_sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","description":"SHA-256 of the terms body — the immutable content anchor. A purchase snapshot pins the hash the buyer saw; later seller edits never change a completed purchase's captured terms."},"retrieved_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"listing_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"listing_status":{"type":"string"},"listing_updated_at_utc":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"pricing":{"type":"object","required":["price_cents","currency","is_free","paid_order_minimum_cents","buyer_total_cents_full_acquisition"],"properties":{"price_cents":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"currency":{"const":"usd"},"is_free":{"type":"boolean"},"paid_order_minimum_cents":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"buyer_total_cents_full_acquisition":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":0,"description":"Computable buyer-total when the listing is paid (gross + processing + delivery); null when free."}}},"acquisition":{"type":"object","required":["acquisition_mode","payment_required","registration_required","download_requires_account_entitlement","download_requires_access_grant"],"properties":{"acquisition_mode":{"type":"string","enum":["PAID_ENTITLED","AUTHENTICATED_FREE_ENTITLED","PUBLIC_TOKEN_GRANT_FREE","PRIVATE_GRANT"]},"payment_required":{"type":"boolean"},"registration_required":{"type":"boolean"},"download_requires_account_entitlement":{"type":"boolean"},"download_requires_access_grant":{"type":"boolean"}}},"delivery":{"type":"object","required":["delivery_kind","packet_bundle"],"properties":{"delivery_kind":{"type":"string","enum":["SINGLE_FILE","PACKET_BUNDLE"]},"packet_bundle":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"Required (non-null) iff delivery_kind=PACKET_BUNDLE. Bounded summary — never per-asset object key, original filename, or asset role.","properties":{"revision_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"revision_number":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"manifest_sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^sha256:[a-f0-9]{64}$"},"asset_count":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"total_bytes":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"frozen_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"}}}}},"packet":{"type":"object","required":["packet_family","packet_kind","packet_manifest_present","manifest_sha256","manifest_signed"],"properties":{"packet_family":{"type":["string","null"]},"packet_kind":{"type":["string","null"]},"packet_manifest_present":{"type":"boolean"},"manifest_sha256":{"type":["string","null"],"pattern":"^sha256:[a-f0-9]{64}$"},"manifest_signed":{"type":"boolean"}}},"rights":{"type":"object","required":["license_family","citation_required","training_allowed","redistribution_allowed","contains_personal_data","update_pattern","access_mode","delivery_mode","transferability","agent_access_allowed"],"properties":{"license_family":{"type":"string"},"citation_required":{"type":"boolean"},"training_allowed":{"type":"boolean"},"redistribution_allowed":{"type":"boolean"},"contains_personal_data":{"type":"string","enum":["NO","ANONYMIZED","YES"]},"update_pattern":{"type":"string"},"access_mode":{"type":"string"},"delivery_mode":{"type":"string"},"transferability":{"const":"NONE"},"agent_access_allowed":{"type":"boolean"}}},"publication":{"type":"object","required":["publication_status","publisher_role","language","has_doi"],"properties":{"publication_status":{"type":["string","null"]},"publisher_role":{"type":["string","null"]},"language":{"type":["string","null"]},"has_doi":{"type":"boolean"}}},"checkout":{"type":"object","required":["current_channel","agent_checkout_available"],"properties":{"current_channel":{"const":"STRIPE_PAYMENT_INTENT","description":"Byte-identical to the durable internal payment-channel column at v0. Names the Stripe primitive used (`automatic_payment_methods.enabled = true` routes cards + Apple Pay + Google Pay + Stripe Link uniformly under one PaymentIntent). Carries no implication of live Shared Payment Token support, agent checkout, or autonomous purchase — `agent_checkout_available` is the explicit machine-readable boolean for that."},"agent_checkout_available":{"const":false,"description":"Explicit machine-readable signal that no autonomous agent checkout is live at v0."}}}}},"ListListingsResponse":{"type":"object","required":["ok","data"],"properties":{"ok":{"const":true},"data":{"type":"object","required":["listings","pagination"],"properties":{"listings":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ListingSummary"}},"pagination":{"type":"object","required":["page","limit","total"],"properties":{"page":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100},"total":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}}}}}}},"ListingDetailResponse":{"type":"object","required":["ok","data"],"properties":{"ok":{"const":true},"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ListingDetail"}}},"RegisterRequest":{"type":"object","required":["name","email","password","type","age_or_capacity_confirmed","accept_terms","acknowledge_privacy","accept_electronic_signature"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"email":{"type":"string","format":"email"},"password":{"type":"string","minLength":12},"type":{"type":"string","enum":["BUYER","SELLER","BOTH"]},"age_or_capacity_confirmed":{"const":true},"accept_terms":{"const":true},"acknowledge_privacy":{"const":true},"accept_electronic_signature":{"const":true},"next":{"type":"string","maxLength":2048,"description":"Same-origin path (e.g. /checkout/{listing_id}) the verification email returns the registrant to. An unsafe value is ignored, not refused."}}},"RegisterResponse":{"type":"object","required":["ok","data"],"properties":{"ok":{"const":true},"data":{"type":"object","required":["message","verification_email_sent"],"properties":{"message":{"type":"string"},"verification_email_sent":{"type":"boolean"}}}}},"LoginRequest":{"type":"object","required":["email","password"],"properties":{"email":{"type":"string","format":"email"},"password":{"type":"string"}}},"AuthResponse":{"type":"object","required":["ok","data"],"properties":{"ok":{"const":true},"data":{"type":"object","required":["token","org_id"],"properties":{"token":{"type":"string","description":"JWT bearer token to use in subsequent requests."},"org_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}}}},"InitiatePurchaseRequest":{"type":"object","required":["listing_id","idempotency_key"],"properties":{"listing_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"idempotency_key":{"type":"string","minLength":8,"description":"Caller-supplied key to deduplicate retries of the same intent."},"entitlement_scope":{"type":"string","enum":["FULL"],"description":"Only FULL is supported."},"buyer_terms_accepted":{"type":"boolean","enum":[true],"description":"Required on a PAID purchase: affirms the checkout notice — 'By continuing to payment, you agree to Graunt's Buyer Terms and Refund Policy.' (read them at /legal/buyer-terms and /legal/refund-policy). Render that sentence beside your payment action. Omitting it on a paid purchase returns 422 BUYER_TERMS_REQUIRED with the exact sentence in error.details.label. Free acquisitions do not use this field."}}},"InitiatePurchaseResponse":{"type":"object","required":["ok","data"],"properties":{"ok":{"const":true},"data":{"type":"object","required":["purchase_id","status"],"properties":{"purchase_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["PENDING_PAYMENT","COMPLETED"]},"client_secret":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Stripe PaymentIntent client secret. Null when the purchase completed synchronously (a free acquisition) or when a replayed purchase is no longer resumable."},"customer_session_client_secret":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Short-lived Stripe Customer Session client secret. Pass it to stripe.elements() alongside client_secret so a returning buyer sees their saved payment methods and can opt in to saving this one. Null when unavailable — the Payment Element still works, without saved-method pre-selection. Single-use: never store, log, or share it."},"gross_amount_cents":{"type":"integer"},"processing_fee_cents":{"type":"integer"},"delivery_fee_cents":{"type":"integer"},"buyer_total_cents":{"type":"integer"},"commercial_terms_snapshot":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CommercialTerms","description":"Immutable purchase-time snapshot of the listing's commercial terms. Captured atomically with the purchase row insert (paid and free paths); never mutated by webhook completion, confirm replay, refund, or idempotency replay. Idempotency replay returns the original snapshot, not a rebuilt one."},"more_from_seller":{"type":"array","maxItems":3,"description":"Up to three paid listings by the same seller that this buyer does not already hold, offered after a free acquisition. Ordered structurally: listings sharing a topic tag with the acquired packet first, then the lowest price, then the id. Disclosure, not a recommendation ranking - it never leaves this seller, nothing is scored, and a seller cannot pay to appear here. Absent (not an empty array) when the seller has nothing else the buyer can buy. Never part of what was charged: the acquisition is complete and free whether or not this block is present.","items":{"type":"object","required":["id","dataset_name","price_cents","delivery_kind","bundle_asset_count","shares_topic"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"dataset_name":{"type":"string"},"price_cents":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Always above zero - a free listing is never offered as a next step to someone who just acquired one free."},"delivery_kind":{"type":"string","enum":["PACKET_BUNDLE","SINGLE_FILE"]},"bundle_asset_count":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":1,"description":"Source files in that listing's published bundle revision; null when it is a single file."},"shares_topic":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether it shares at least one topic tag with the packet just acquired. Explains the order; it is not a score."}}}}}}}},"DownloadResponse":{"type":"object","required":["ok","data"],"properties":{"ok":{"const":true},"data":{"type":"object","required":["download_url","expires_in_seconds","downloads_remaining"],"properties":{"download_url":{"type":"string","format":"uri","description":"Presigned URL. TTL is <= 15 minutes per platform rule; the current value is 600 seconds."},"expires_in_seconds":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":900},"downloads_remaining":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"content_sha256":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"SHA-256 of the asset file, lowercase hex."},"file_size_bytes":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":0}}}}},"PacketBundleAssetDelivery":{"type":"object","description":"Per-asset bundle delivery row. download_url is a short-lived presigned URL — never log, never persist.","required":["asset_id","ordering","asset_role","file_format","file_size_bytes","content_sha256","original_filename","download_url","expires_at"],"properties":{"asset_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"ordering":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":255},"asset_role":{"type":"string","enum":["PRIMARY","SUPPORTING","EVIDENCE","MANIFEST","LEGAL_NOTICE"]},"file_format":{"type":"string"},"file_size_bytes":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"content_sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^sha256:[a-f0-9]{64}$"},"original_filename":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":255},"download_url":{"type":"string","format":"uri","description":"Short-lived presigned URL (TTL 600 seconds). Sensitive — must not be logged, audited, or persisted."},"expires_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"Shared across every asset_role in one response."}}},"EntitlementPacketBundleResponse":{"type":"object","required":["ok","data"],"properties":{"ok":{"const":true},"data":{"type":"object","required":["entitlement_id","listing_id","delivery_kind","packet_bundle_revision_id","bundle_id","revision_number","manifest_sha256","total_bytes","asset_count","expires_at","downloads_remaining","assets"],"properties":{"entitlement_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"listing_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"delivery_kind":{"type":"string","const":"PACKET_BUNDLE"},"packet_bundle_revision_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"bundle_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"revision_number":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"manifest_sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^sha256:[a-f0-9]{64}$"},"total_bytes":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"asset_count":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"expires_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"downloads_remaining":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"assets":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"$ref":"#/com